WEBVTT

01:24.869 --> 01:29.010
LAZARUS

01:56.869 --> 01:57.851
Cold.

01:58.702 --> 02:03.165
#08: UNFORGETTABLE FIRE

02:03.373 --> 02:05.317
I am home.

02:08.651 --> 02:09.404
Huh?

02:10.298 --> 02:12.115
Why is the atmosphere so gloomy?

02:12.634 --> 02:14.076
Where is Brother Chris?

02:15.053 --> 02:16.804
We were just about to discuss it.

02:16.867 --> 02:19.136
Before that, there is something that needs to be done
let's discuss it first.

02:19.740 --> 02:24.328
The Hague Research Center where
Skinner researches that Hapna has been closed...

02:24.773 --> 02:28.674
...but Eleina has already investigated
the researchers who work there.

02:30.151 --> 02:31.927
Huh? Hersch?

02:32.258 --> 02:33.297
Huh?

02:33.384 --> 02:36.472
So you're Skinner's ex-friend, huh?

02:36.814 --> 02:40.484
Can you give
reasonable explanation?

02:43.331 --> 02:44.147
Alright.

02:44.958 --> 02:48.193
Besides, I'm sure sooner or later
you will know about this.

02:48.502 --> 02:49.166
DOCTOR HERSCH LINDEMANN
RESEARCH SCIENTIST

02:49.191 --> 02:52.781
I am indeed Skinner's colleague.
time in The Hague.

02:53.549 --> 02:55.575
I also participated in
Hapna development.

02:56.657 --> 02:59.788
But, he disappeared right before
the drug was perfected.

03:00.640 --> 03:05.210
Me and my other colleagues too
not told anything.

03:05.812 --> 03:09.315
Soon after,
I stopped researching.

03:10.024 --> 03:13.260
Then, when he came back
three years later...

03:13.903 --> 03:17.347
...Hapna has become a medicine
that destroys the world.

03:18.157 --> 03:21.685
We don't even know
the structure of the drug.

03:23.162 --> 03:25.689
Then, who is your employer now?

03:26.291 --> 03:28.734
You can guess it, right?

03:29.273 --> 03:32.296
Possibly, separate squads
which are made...

03:32.338 --> 03:34.239
...within the scope of the NSA.

03:34.654 --> 03:35.173
Huh?

03:35.340 --> 03:36.533
That's right.

03:37.218 --> 03:39.745
As one of the people who
getting to know Skinner...

03:39.951 --> 03:41.494
...I was asked to establish Lazarus.

03:41.723 --> 03:43.040
Separate squads?

03:43.280 --> 03:47.270
Means a disposable squad
anytime, yeah?

03:47.434 --> 03:52.007
I haven't understood anything since earlier.

03:52.546 --> 03:54.760
The point is, where did Brother Chris go?

04:01.951 --> 04:03.477
Where is this?

04:03.938 --> 04:05.104
Take a guess.

04:06.873 --> 04:08.523
The temperature is almost zero degrees.

04:08.833 --> 04:11.026
There was the smell of oil and seagulls.

04:11.524 --> 04:12.694
Close to the north pole.

04:13.276 --> 04:14.479
Possibly Barents.

04:15.089 --> 04:16.281
Barents Offshore Platform.

04:18.823 --> 04:21.828
I heard you're a former investigator...

04:23.151 --> 04:25.276
...it turns out your instincts haven't dulled, huh?

04:26.142 --> 04:28.311
Death penalty for traitors!

04:30.209 --> 04:31.546
What are you doing, Sergen?

04:38.092 --> 04:40.931
He tried to escape...

04:43.241 --> 04:45.435
I'm glad you're still alive.

04:45.768 --> 04:46.895
Alexandra.

04:48.039 --> 04:48.939
Inga.

04:49.270 --> 04:53.693
Because I always want to kill you
with my own hands.

04:56.047 --> 04:56.902
OFFSHORE RISK,
BARENTS SEA

04:56.926 --> 04:59.825
Chris has been unreachable since yesterday.

05:00.276 --> 05:04.079
According to GPS, he is located
in the Russian region near the North Pole.

05:04.625 --> 05:06.057
On the offshore platform
which is neglected.

05:06.179 --> 05:08.734
The North Pole?
Why so far away?

05:08.940 --> 05:14.297
The offshore platform is likely
it has become the headquarters of the investigative agency.

05:14.732 --> 05:17.259
Does that mean Chris was kidnapped by them?

05:17.694 --> 05:18.218
Huh?

05:18.443 --> 05:20.429
If he can't be contacted
in three days...

05:20.885 --> 05:25.016
...the bracelet will stop
blood flow and kill him.

05:26.043 --> 05:29.062
Chris himself suggested this system.

05:29.089 --> 05:29.709
PASSPORT
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA

05:29.734 --> 05:32.524
<i>Her real name is not Christine Blake.</i>

05:33.064 --> 05:35.918
<i>He's a former Russian investigator.</i>

05:36.079 --> 05:36.990
Huh?

05:37.672 --> 05:41.179
<i>He defected,</i>
<i>changing his name and face...</i>

05:41.239 --> 05:42.701
<i>...and then join Lazarus.</i>

05:43.449 --> 05:47.497
Then, he understood that he had to
risk your life...

05:47.699 --> 05:50.542
...for a former investigator like him
can be trusted.

05:53.444 --> 05:56.339
Even though your appearance has changed,
your gaze remains the same.

05:56.732 --> 05:58.717
A view that refuses to give in
to anyone.

06:01.634 --> 06:06.433
I heard you died in an incident.
at the airport three years ago.

06:12.915 --> 06:17.444
I'm sure you're still alive
because your body was not found.

06:18.254 --> 06:20.822
I will make you regret it
slowly.

06:21.070 --> 06:23.200
You can patiently wait for help.

06:23.741 --> 06:27.412
That is if there is anyone who wants to
helping traitors.

06:30.569 --> 06:32.584
We don't have any more time.

06:32.832 --> 06:34.544
It's been a day already.

06:34.917 --> 06:35.921
Only two days left.

06:36.390 --> 06:39.774
We just have to bring it back
in two days, right?

06:40.006 --> 06:40.692
Impossible.

06:41.257 --> 06:43.261
Our opponent is
Russian special investigative agency.

06:43.801 --> 06:47.017
In addition, there is a possibility that Chris
who came there himself.

06:47.212 --> 06:48.683
Do you want to ignore it?

06:49.014 --> 06:49.851
I go.

06:50.077 --> 06:51.430
Me too.

06:51.559 --> 06:52.604
I will go too.

06:53.019 --> 06:55.941
Or do you want to eliminate
all of us with this bracelet?

06:56.562 --> 06:57.890
Mom...

06:58.900 --> 06:59.736
Excuse me!

07:02.423 --> 07:06.076
Let me say first,
I don't know where Skinner is.

07:06.511 --> 07:07.827
Why do you think so?

07:08.179 --> 07:12.082
Now, the entire world information center
looking for Skinner.

07:12.538 --> 07:15.460
The ship that passed me
You guys have one in Tuvalu too, right?

07:21.172 --> 07:23.609
We should report it immediately.
to the main headquarters.

07:23.653 --> 07:25.238
Don't do anything silly.

07:25.569 --> 07:27.514
This is my personal problem.

07:29.388 --> 07:30.183
It's me.

07:31.399 --> 07:33.019
Yes, no problem.

07:33.193 --> 07:34.361
<i>If there is something odd...</i>

07:35.394 --> 07:36.564
Why is your expression like that?

07:37.438 --> 07:39.317
You don't dare
deny his statement?

07:40.829 --> 07:42.945
Don't put on such an arrogant expression!

07:58.729 --> 08:01.468
OSLO AIRPORT, NORWAY

08:01.508 --> 08:03.531
<i>We have indeed arrived in Oslo...</i>

08:03.651 --> 08:05.210
<i>...but here's where the problem begins.</i>

08:05.383 --> 08:07.452
If we can
to the north coast of Norway...

08:07.697 --> 08:09.991
...we should be able to go
to the location by boat.

08:10.324 --> 08:13.143
It's useless. All flights cancelled
due to bad weather.

08:13.869 --> 08:17.224
We can't use the car either
due to many road closures.

08:17.478 --> 08:18.606
How about this?

08:18.833 --> 08:20.775
There is only one day left.

08:23.170 --> 08:24.088
Herschel?

08:24.922 --> 08:25.947
<i>Wait there.</i>

08:26.382 --> 08:29.826
<i>The European military will pick up and</i>
<i>take you by helicopter.</i>

08:29.927 --> 08:30.715
Huh?

08:30.908 --> 08:33.073
<i>I have also contacted</i>
<i>Norwegian government.</i>

08:33.327 --> 08:36.624
<i>Alesund Research Centre can also</i>
<i>become Eleina's headquarters.</i>

08:36.851 --> 08:37.417
Huh?

08:39.083 --> 08:40.086
Can we go?

08:41.252 --> 08:43.715
This is an off-mission action.

08:44.525 --> 08:49.608
But, I don't want to either
lost Chris.

08:55.125 --> 08:59.593
LAZARUS

09:22.871 --> 09:23.713
How?

09:23.887 --> 09:27.092
Have you remembered a little?
about obedience?

09:27.444 --> 09:31.596
You say that, but you can only
beat up a tied up woman, right?

09:31.844 --> 09:32.347
Huh?

09:32.637 --> 09:33.765
What a coward.

09:36.494 --> 09:41.999
ALESUND RESEARCH CENTER, NORWAY

09:42.730 --> 09:46.546
<i>It's a shame, but we can only</i>
<i>help get here.</i>

09:46.839 --> 09:47.804
<i>This is enough.</i>

09:48.158 --> 09:49.367
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

09:56.833 --> 09:59.875
Eleina, what is the access from outside?
absolutely impossible?

10:00.378 --> 10:02.419
The offshore platform
not connected to the internet.

10:03.153 --> 10:05.810
But, there must be something in there
its network system.

10:05.864 --> 10:08.091
If it is enabled,
I can access it.

10:15.163 --> 10:17.143
I can leave anytime.

10:17.375 --> 10:19.169
Drones are also ready.

10:19.586 --> 10:22.130
<i>Be careful when you enter</i>
Russian waters.

10:22.776 --> 10:24.462
<i>Due to all the ice chunks</i>
<i>has melted...</i>

10:24.591 --> 10:28.256
<i>...military tensions around</i>
<i>The Arctic Ocean is rising.</i>

10:29.032 --> 10:30.551
<i>If the problem gets out of control...</i>

10:30.639 --> 10:33.100
<i>...the worst possibility</i>
<i>war could happen.</i>

10:39.598 --> 10:40.973
It's useless.

10:41.733 --> 10:45.629
You want to make me angry
to untie you, right?

10:45.820 --> 10:48.948
Wow, it turns out it's you
not as stupid as i thought.

11:14.182 --> 11:15.424
There he is.

11:15.912 --> 11:17.504
Enemies seen from above
there are six people.

11:17.977 --> 11:19.746
They were carrying firearms.

11:51.740 --> 11:53.227
Turn right on the second floor.

11:53.680 --> 11:55.449
The network space is around there.

11:55.758 --> 11:56.825
Okay.

11:56.933 --> 11:58.643
Doug, please make some noise.

12:06.060 --> 12:09.500
<i>Non-affiliated vessel approaching</i>
<i>from Norwegian waters.</i>

12:10.091 --> 12:12.883
<i>Already entered Russian waters</i>
<i>and keep getting closer.</i>

12:13.404 --> 12:14.384
Keep an eye out.

12:14.868 --> 12:17.012
Commander A, standby on the east side.

12:17.474 --> 12:18.680
I'll be there soon.

12:33.143 --> 12:37.915
We haven't reported to headquarters yet.
if I've caught you.

12:38.183 --> 12:41.993
That's because Inga wants to
punish you directly.

12:43.313 --> 12:49.319
But, the incident during the interrogation
happens often, right?

12:50.737 --> 12:52.486
<i>A large ship is approaching!</i>

12:52.614 --> 12:53.882
<i>All personnel, remain alert!</i>

12:54.245 --> 12:56.372
Go. I'll catch up.

12:56.618 --> 12:59.554
Inga said not to kill him...

13:01.896 --> 13:02.599
No...

13:04.056 --> 13:05.407
ANALYZE

13:08.090 --> 13:08.772
Here he is!

13:36.741 --> 13:38.302
Commander B, to the tanker!

13:38.493 --> 13:40.005
Squad G, put out the fire!

13:51.289 --> 13:52.110
Damn it.

14:19.696 --> 14:20.427
Chris!

14:20.619 --> 14:23.192
Found him! He just came out of the medical room.
and is walking down the hall!

14:23.306 --> 14:24.332
<i>He's alone!</i>

14:24.372 --> 14:25.289
Okay!

14:44.248 --> 14:45.368
<i>The tanker is empty!</i>

14:45.644 --> 14:47.997
The ship is just bait!
There's an intruder!

15:05.808 --> 15:08.044
Axel!
Two people in front of you!

15:47.330 --> 15:48.372
Who?

16:13.782 --> 16:14.783
Leland!

16:30.624 --> 16:32.350
<i>Axel, I will guide you!</i>

16:32.626 --> 16:33.297
Please help!

16:46.764 --> 16:48.934
Hey, can you walk?

16:49.184 --> 16:49.993
Let us go home.

16:50.894 --> 16:52.078
Why did you come?

16:52.400 --> 16:53.110
Huh?

16:54.271 --> 16:57.792
I don't deserve to be saved.

16:58.693 --> 16:59.586
Because...

16:59.960 --> 17:03.506
We don't care about your past.

17:08.306 --> 17:10.138
We came to help
the person you are now.

17:22.884 --> 17:23.885
Wait here.

17:24.261 --> 17:25.637
I'll take care of them first.

17:41.089 --> 17:46.832
The last three years, I've been thinking
to kill you.

17:48.827 --> 17:50.121
Just shoot.

17:52.435 --> 17:54.988
I would be proud if I was killed by you.

17:55.166 --> 17:58.136
Who would believe
traitor's words?

17:59.635 --> 18:02.276
Time to see you
after three years have passed...

18:02.591 --> 18:04.150
...my body can't move.

18:09.826 --> 18:12.829
I changed my face and my name...

18:13.267 --> 18:16.120
...but my heart cannot be replaced.

18:17.959 --> 18:21.652
Why after the incident at the airport...

18:21.921 --> 18:23.127
Why did you disappear?

18:25.341 --> 18:26.522
At that time...

18:27.135 --> 18:30.930
<i>...I was involved in an incident</i>
<i>and has died once.</i>

18:31.930 --> 18:36.035
<i>After my vital signs disappeared</i>
<i>and entered the victim list...</i>

18:36.122 --> 18:37.642
<i>...I can breathe again.</i>

18:38.293 --> 18:39.769
<i>I thought too...</i>

18:40.398 --> 18:43.898
If I am considered dead,
I can escape from the organization.

18:45.509 --> 18:47.944
You left me?

18:49.115 --> 18:52.073
If I get caught running away,
you will be killed too!

18:53.016 --> 18:54.242
So...

18:54.601 --> 18:56.494
...I must die.

19:00.168 --> 19:01.165
Let's run away.

19:01.691 --> 19:02.417
Huh?

19:03.004 --> 19:05.128
Let's get out of here.

19:06.530 --> 19:07.505
Can't.

19:07.925 --> 19:08.781
Huh?

19:09.908 --> 19:12.886
That is simply impossible.

19:14.371 --> 19:15.805
Sasha...

19:23.024 --> 19:24.567
This is your fault.

19:25.131 --> 19:28.651
Because of you, there is nothing
who loves me again.

19:43.002 --> 19:44.670
Death penalty...

19:46.151 --> 19:48.171
...for traitors!

20:01.835 --> 20:03.188
Axel, hurry up!

20:03.378 --> 20:05.939
If you keep going like this, you're going to explode.
with offshore platforms!

20:09.737 --> 20:10.696
Inga.

20:11.418 --> 20:12.445
Remember!

20:13.282 --> 20:16.869
I am grateful to have met you
for the last time.

20:18.393 --> 20:24.165
Live for me too, Sashenka.

20:41.109 --> 20:42.132
Hey!

21:00.191 --> 21:01.519
Chris! Axel!

21:01.559 --> 21:02.590
Hurry back!

21:02.918 --> 21:03.777
Be careful!

21:19.863 --> 21:20.993
Axel!

21:21.017 --> 21:22.222
Chris!

21:43.061 --> 21:44.980
<i>Chris' rescue mission is complete!</i>

21:45.458 --> 21:46.834
<i>We're going back to base!</i>

22:15.613 --> 22:18.866
12 DAYS LEFT

23:50.124 --> 23:55.045
NEXT EPISODE:
DEATH IN HUMAN FORM
